    "end": 10.4
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "Carol",
   "en": "I'm making a shopping list, Tom.",
   "zh": "我在写购物单，汤姆。",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L079.mp4",
    "start": 10.4,
    "end": 13.8
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "Tom",
   "en": "What do we need?",
   "zh": "我们都需要什么？",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L079.mp4",
    "start": 13.8,
    "end": 15.6
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "Carol",
   "en": "We need a lot of things this week.",
   "zh": "这星期我们需要很多东西。",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L079.mp4",
    "start": 15.6,
    "end": 19.2
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "Carol",
   "en": "I must go to the grocer's.",
   "zh": "我得去一下食品店。",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L079.mp4",
    "start": 19.2,
    "end": 22.8
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "Carol",
   "en": "We haven't got much tea or coffee,",
   "zh": "我们的茶叶和咖啡不多了，",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L079.mp4",
    "start": 22.8,
    "end": 25.8
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "Carol",
   "en": "and we haven't got any sugar or jam.",
   "zh": "糖和果酱也没有了。",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L079.mp4",
    "start": 25.8,
    "end": 29.5
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "Tom",
   "en": "What about vegetables?",
   "zh": "蔬菜呢？",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L079.mp4",
    "start": 29.5,
    "end": 32.8
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "Carol",
   "en": "I must go to the greengrocer's.",
   "zh": "我还得到蔬菜水果店去一下。",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L079.mp4",
    "start": 32.8,
    "end": 35.8
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "Carol",
   "en": "We haven't got many tomatoes,",
   "zh": "我们的番茄不多了，",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L079.mp4",
    "start": 35.8,
    "end": 38.9
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "Carol",
   "en": "but we've got a lot of potatoes.",
   "zh": "但土豆还有不少。",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L079.mp4",
    "start": 38.9,
    "end": 42.4
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "Carol",
   "en": "I must go to the butcher's, too.",
   "zh": "我还要到肉店去一下。",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L079.mp4",
    "start": 42.4,
    "end": 45.4
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "Carol",
   "en": "We need some meat.",
   "zh": "我们需要些肉。",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L079.mp4",
    "start": 45.4,
    "end": 47.4
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "Carol",
   "en": "We haven't got any meat at all.",
   "zh": "我们一点肉也没有了。",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L079.mp4",
    "start": 47.4,
    "end": 50.3
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "Tom",
   "en": "Have we got any beer and wine?",
   "zh": "我们还有啤酒和葡萄酒吗？",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L079.mp4",
    "start": 50.3,
    "end": 52.9
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "Carol",
   "en": "No, we haven't.",
   "zh": "没有了。",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L079.mp4",
    "start": 52.9,
    "end": 54.2
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "Carol",
   "en": "And I'm not going to get any!",
   "zh": "不过，我不打算去买！",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L079.mp4",
    "start": 54.2,
    "end": 56.7
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "Tom",
   "en": "I hope that you've got some money.",
   "zh": "我希望你还有钱。",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L079.mp4",
    "start": 56.7,
    "end": 59.9
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "Carol",
   "en": "I haven't got much.",
   "zh": "我的钱不多了。",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L079.mp4",
    "start": 59.9,
    "end": 62
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "Tom",
   "en": "Well, I haven't got much either!",
   "zh": "唉，我也不多了！",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L079.mp4",
    "start": 62,
    "end": 66
   }
  }
